  "notes": "{除|のぞ}く means to remove, exclude, or eliminate something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ for the thing being removed or excluded\n\nHOMOPHONE ALERT:\n- {除|のぞ}く (this word): to remove, exclude\n- ⟦{覗|のぞ}く→覗く：02388_nozoku⟧: to peek, peep (different kanji and meaning)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{除|のぞ}いて: excluding ~, except for ~\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{除|のぞ}く: to remove ~\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{除|のぞ}けば: if we exclude ~\n\nEXAMPLE CONTEXTS:\n- ⟦{汚|よご}れ→汚れ：03186_yogore⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{除|のぞ}く: to remove dirt\n- ⟦{例外|れいがい}→例外：03798_reigai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{除|のぞ}く: to exclude exceptions\n- ⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{除|のぞ}いて⟦{全員|ぜんいん}→全員：03310_zenin⟧: everyone except him",
